# Testing

- No network. No live `cursor-agent` unless `@pytest.mark.cursor`.
- Use `tests/fake_bin/gh` and `tests/fixtures/` over mocks.
- Goldens via syrupy. Intentional updates only through `make goldens`.
- Never edit or delete an existing test to make a change pass.
- `tests/test_architecture.py` must keep import-direction and subprocess invariants.
